                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Mostly match 3 , nicely varies game play with a few other puzzles and hidden object scenes. A fun aspect was the battles every so often. The character and story were fun, not overly involved or wordy. earning power ups  made it interesting too. No bugs at all for me and the levels were challenging but acheivable.  The graphics were lush and detailed but not overly so to the point of being hard on the eyes like some games can be. Over all a very well balanced game in all aspects. I liked it so much I am seeking out more of this developers games and Mystica 1 & 2.",
